    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Apartment 128 Ivy Exchange built in c.2005, Ivy Exchange is modern development located in Parnell Street and so benefits from having lots of amenities on its doorstep. Supermarkets right across the road, Cinemas, Restaurants, Colleges and Hospitals within walking distance too. Excellent transport options nearby with Green and Red Luas lines and plentiful Bus Routes on O`Connell Street.\r\n\r\nThe apartment is located on the sixth floor in a block served by lift and comprises of a bright open plan kitchen / sitting room. The kitchen is a well proportioned room and comes fitted with appliances. There are two large double bedrooms and one single bedroom, which also offer some excellent views. The main bathroom accessed from the hall is fitted with a bath, WHB and WC.\r\n\r\n\r\nThe property comes to the market in a great condition and benefits from laminate flooring, electric heating, double glazing, spacious rooms and parking. Current service charge is 3238.62. The property comes with one designated parking space located in the underground car park.\r\n\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: The information contained in this advertisement is provided for guidance only and is given in good faith. While every effort has been made to ensure accuracy, Handing Capital does not warrant the completeness or accuracy of the information and accepts no liability for any errors or omissions. All measurements are approximate and for identification purposes only. The property particulars do not constitute any part of an offer or contract. Intending purchasers/tenants should satisfy themselves as to the correctness of the information provided. Prices and availability are subject to change without notice. Services, fittings and appliances have not been tested."
      },
